ttps://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=93s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>nice, because it's a <u>4</u>-1-1 <u>4</u> slicer<br><b>good alg:</b> pair on the <b>frontslash</b> line → paws<br><b>bad alg:</b> pair on the <b>backslash</b> line → paws","3-3/Paired Edges":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=131s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>nice, because 3-3 is always good<br><b>good alg:</b> pair on the <b>frontslash</b> line, 2 slices → scallop/kite<br><b>bad alg:</b> pair on the <b>backslash</b> line, 2 slices → scallop/kite","3-1-2/Paired Edges":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=163s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>evil, because 3-x-x is usually bad<br><b>good alg:</b> 2 slices → shield/square<br><b>bad alg:</b> → 5-1/L","3-2-1/Paired Edges":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=163s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>evil, because 3-x-x is usually bad<br><b>good alg:</b> 2 slices → shield/square<br><b>bad alg:</b> → 5-1/L","Scallop/Shield":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=242s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>nice, because scallops have their shells, which are kinda like shields, so this CS makes sense<br><b>good alg:</b> hide a pair on the <b>frontslash</b> line, 2 slices → scallops<br><b>bad alg:</b> hide a pair on the <b>backslash</b> line, 2 slices → scallops","Scallop/Left Fist":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=295s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>follow, because a fist can eat the scallop (fist dominates)<br><b>good alg:</b> 2 slices <b>2-gen</b> to scallop/kite<br><b>bad alg:</b> 2 slices <b>3-gen</b> to scallop/kite","Scallop/Right Fist":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=295s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>follow, because a fist can eat the scallop (fist dominates)<br><b>good alg:</b> 2 slices <b>2-gen</b> to scallop/kite<br><b>bad alg:</b> 2 slices <b>3-gen</b> to scallop/kite","Shield/Left Fist":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=382s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>evil, because a medieval weapon (shield) is not enough to fight an angry person nowadays, you are dead<br><b>good alg:</b> 2 slices <b>2-gen</b> → paws<br><b>bad alg:</b> 2 slices <b>3-gen</b> → paws","Shield/Right Fist":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=382s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>evil, because a medieval weapon (shield) is not enough to fight an angry person nowadays, you are dead<br><b>good alg:</b> 2 slices <b>2-gen</b> → paws<br><b>bad alg:</b> 2 slices <b>3-gen</b> → paws","6/Paired Edges":"<a href=\"https://youtu.be/kKOSxk84v90&t=438s\" target=\"blank\">video timestamp</a><br>evil, because both shape are symmetrical but are not sliceable at the symmetry axis (the concentrated power of the 6 met its match in the concentrated poewr of the pair)<br><b>good alg:</b> pair on the <b>frontslash</b> line → scallops<br><b>bad alg:</b> pair on the <b>backslash</b> line → scallops"},"colorScheme":{"topColor":"#000000","bottomColor":"#FFFFFF","frontColor":"#CC0000","rightColor":"#00AA00","backColor":"#FF8C00","leftColor":"#0066CC","dividerColor":"#7a0000","circleColor":"transparent"},"customShapesForParityTracerLibrary":"{\"ECECECEC\":\"Square\",\"EECCEECC\":\"Barrel\",\"EECCECEC\":\"Left Fist\",\"EECEECCC\":\"Shield\",\"EEECECCC\":\"Left Pawn\",\"ECEEECCC\":\"Right Pawn\",\"EEEECCCC\":\"Scallop\",\"EECCCCC\":\"Pair\",\"ECECCCC\":\"L-Shape\",\"EEEEEECCC\":\"6-0\",\"EEEECEECC\":\"Left 4-2\",\"EEEECECEC\":\"4-1-1\",\"EEECEEECC\":\"3-3\",\"EECEECEEC\":\"2-2-2\",\"EEEEEEEECC\":\"8-0\",\"EEEEEECEEC\":\"6-2\",\"EEEECEEEEC\":\"4-4\",\"EEEEEEECEC\":\"7-1\",\"CCCCCC\":\"Star\",\"EEECECEEC\":\"3-1-2\",\"EEECEECEC\":\"3-2-1\",\"EEEECCEEC\":\"Right 4-2\",\"CEEEEECEC\":\"Left 5-1\",\"CEEEEECCE\":\"Right 5-1\",\"CEEEEECEEE\":\"5-3\",\"CEECECCE\":\"Kite\",\"ECCECCC\":\"Line\",\"EECCECCE\":\"Muffin\",\"CEECECEC\":\"Right Fist\"}","cornerStickerMode":"clockwise","evilnessFactor":true,"evilnessStringReturn":true,"evilnessMap":{"Muff